# Keyboard color

This window sets the color and brightness of the Razer Ornata V3 X as one lighting zone. Lighting commands use the 90-byte feature report. Open that interface without seizing it, or the keys stop typing.

Check packets with the built binary's `--check` after `swift build --disable-sandbox`.

Committed text describes the program. It does not name a machine, a filesystem path, or instructions copied from another repository.
